   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media Management Centre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Media Management Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet ger utbildning i management och planering till personer i ledande st&#xe4;llning inom oberoende mediaf&#xf6;retag p&#xe5; Balkan. Kurser finns p&#xe5; flera niv&#xe5;er och syftar till att ge en grund f&#xf6;r ekonomiskt oberoende f&#xf6;r deltagande medier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides management and planning education for top-level staff (editors, directors, financial staff) within independent media companies in the Balkans. Courses are given on several levels and aim at giving a foundation for financial independence for the participating media.</narrative>
  </description>
